  "scope": "Development-only real-browser DOM geometry, leaf text-span bounds, raw KaTeX SVG path data when present, and a browser screenshot artifact. Primitive pixel pilot adds tall fraction, literal verbatim punctuation and spacing, and poor-man-bold glyph/relation/vector overflow cases. Does not claim full math-dialect parity or glyph-to-math-node component mapping."
